+     * {@link TradesService.buy}/{@link TradesService.sell} — the exact same order pipeline
+     * (idempotency, balance deduction, real Stake row, pot updates) a human's own request
+     * takes. The house account is RpcUser-linked, so its stake is excluded from "real"
+     * exposure and from real payout eligibility at settlement, like every RPC bot.
+     *
